                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d3099b1-32c6-481a-8400-8d946b0a7a31",
                                                "sense_id": "4343e11a-361f-3dd5-b967-d1a84222da02",
                                                "text": "The bus went through a railway barrier and was hit by a train."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b8cef59-62d3-4f43-91ec-4ade887c8b8e",
                                                "sense_id": "4343e11a-361f-3dd5-b967-d1a84222da02",
                                                "text": "The bomber had passed through one checkpoint before blowing himself up at a second barrier."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f5f6114-fbbd-3137-84e5-33e90101f0ab",
                                        "entry_id": "87587a69-1cbf-3cf8-8ee5-0a0c835121eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An obstacle or impediment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee589ac5-4c93-4c62-85f2-9d04bf568856",
                                                "sense_id": "9f5f6114-fbbd-3137-84e5-33e90101f0ab",
                                                "text": "Even a small fee can be a barrier for some students."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39287131-7452-4fbd-8eaf-27be8704171d",
                                                "sense_id": "9f5f6114-fbbd-3137-84e5-33e90101f0ab",
                                                "text": "America’s poverty line is $63 a day for a family of four. In the richer parts of the emerging world $4 a day is the poverty barrier. But poverty’s scourge is fiercest below $1.25 ([…]): people below that level live lives that are poor, nasty, brutish and short."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a85c0461-62ba-3624-b1de-04da0742eb9f",
                                        "entry_id": "87587a69-1cbf-3cf8-8ee5-0a0c835121eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A boundary or limit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78750631-d033-4297-88de-6d74f4ee3f1a",
                                                "sense_id": "a85c0461-62ba-3624-b1de-04da0742eb9f",
                                                "text": "Few marathon runners break the three-hour time barrier."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca15997c-9ea3-4485-ae87-3b509b3bcacb",
                                                "sense_id": "a85c0461-62ba-3624-b1de-04da0742eb9f",
                                                "text": "The downside of normalization is that it erects a defensive barrier between the real world and the perceived i.e. normalized world."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "032b05f3-4785-3fb1-9635-41ca1decc50f",
                                        "entry_id": "87587a69-1cbf-3cf8-8ee5-0a0c835121eb",
                                        "glosses": [
